  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492540/diamond-spheres-harmony-and-discord?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Harmony &amp; Discord</a></sup></p>\n<p>Whenever you bribe a creature, you treat their level as being 2 lower for determining how many gold pieces they expect (see bribes). You can spend 1 use of skill leverage when attempting to bribe a creature to treat their level as being 1 additional lower, plus 1 per 5 ranks in the sphere’s associated skill you possess.</p>\n<p>You gain a +2 bonus to Diplomacy checks made to bribe someone and to Diplomacy and Charisma checks made to bargain with a conjured creature (such as with planar ally or planar binding), increasing by 1 per 5 ranks in the sphere’s associated skill you possess.</p>\n<p>Additionally, the first time a specific creature refuses a bribe that you offer, their attitude towards you does not worsen (even if the attempt would normally offend them). Plus, a creature that you fail to bribe only reports you to the authorities (or their equivalent) if you fail the attempt by 5 or more.</p>\n<p><strong>Associated Feat:</strong> Persuasive Bribery (<em>Ultimate Intrigue</em>).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/communication#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
